t-lang.org/2015/01/09/Rust-1.0-alpha/\">Announcing Rust 1.0 Alpha</a></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"bn\"></td>\n        <td class=\"bn\"><h3 class=\"f0-l f1-m f2-s mt4 mb0\">Posts in 2014</h3></td>\n      </tr>\n      \n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"tr o-60 pr4 pr5-l bn\">Dec.&nbsp;12</td>\n        <td class=\"bn\"><a href=\"https://blog.rust-lang.org/2014/12/12/Core-Team/\">Yehuda Katz and Steve Klabnik are joining the Rust Core Team</a></td>\n      </tr>\n      \n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"tr o-60 pr4 pr5-l bn\">Dec.&nbsp;12</td>\n        <td class=\"bn\"><a href=\"https://blog.rust-lang.org/2014/12/12/1.0-Timeline/\">Rust 1.0: Scheduling the trains</a></td>\n      </tr>\n      \n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"tr o-60 pr4 pr5-l bn\">Nov.&nbsp;20</td>\n        <td class=\"bn\"><a href=\"https://blog.rust-lang.org/2014/11/20/Cargo/\">Cargo: Rust&#x27;s community crate host</a></td>\n      </tr>\n      \n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"tr o-60 pr4 pr5-l bn\">Oct.&nbsp;30</td>\n        <td class=\"bn\"><a href=\"https://blog.rust-lang.org/2014/10/30/Stability/\">Stability as a Deliverable</a></td>\n      </tr>\n      \n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"tr o-60 pr4 pr5-l bn\">Sept.&nbsp;15</td>\n        <td class=\"bn\"><a href=\"https://blog.rust-lang.org/2014/09/15/Rust-1.0/\">Road to Rust 1.0</a></td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"w-100 mw-none ph3 mw8-m mw9-l center f3\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <div class=\"four columns mt3 mt0-l\" id=\"get-help\">\n            <h4>Get help!</h4>\n            <ul>\n              <li><a href=\"https://doc.rust-lang.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Documentation</a></li>\n              <li><a href=\"mailto:core-team@rust-lang.org\">Contact the Rust Team</a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"four columns mt3 mt0-l\">\n            <h4>Terms and policies</h4>\n            <ul>\n     